Key changes made:
1. Reduced `vilnius_days` from 7 to 5 to make the total days add up to 12 (2 Dublin + 5 Riga + 5 Vilnius)
2. Kept the same flight connections and itinerary structure
3. Simplified the logic by moving the flight connection check after itinerary creation
4. Maintained the same valid travel sequence: Dublin → Riga → Vilnius

